 "frontmatter": {
  "title": "April 2026 - Pointer Cursor",
  "description": "Add cursor pointer behavior for buttons during project setup.",
  "date": "2026-04-25T00:00:00.000Z"
 },
 "toc": [],
 "hast": "\n<p>You can now enable <code>cursor: pointer</code> for buttons when initializing a project.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest init --pointer\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest init --pointer\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest init --pointer\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest init --pointer\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest init --pointer\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> --pointer</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>This adds the following CSS to your global CSS file:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">globals.css</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"@layer base {\n  button:not(:disabled),\n  [role=&#x22;button&#x22;]:not(:disabled) {\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n}\" data-language=\"css\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">@layer</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> base {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  button</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">:not</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">:disabled</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">),</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  [</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">role</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"button\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">]</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">:not</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">:disabled</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">    cursor</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> pointer</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>The <code>--pointer</code> option is not part of preset codes. It is applied as a project setup option, similar to <code>--rtl</code>.</p>"
}
